Shob's Cursor, Nord, Tokyo Night, Vercel, Dracula, Matrix, Night Owl (dark),
Orng, and Vesper palettes are adapted from OpenCode's theme assets:
https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/tree/dfce18305dd2b8ec1873fc819926b125c6d9a6e4/packages/tui/src/theme/assets

OpenCode's Night Owl asset uses the dark palette in both modes. Shob's light
variant is adapted from Sarah Drasner's Light Owl color theme:
https://github.com/sdras/night-owl-vscode-theme/tree/cc291eba7976b20d7c66bde6883c27b902196b07/themes

